0x500.jpg 500w, https://www.gklibrarykor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/lactose_thumbnail-480x480.jpg 480w, https://www.gklibrarykor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/lactose_thumbnail.jpg 720w" sizes="(max-width:767px) 150px, 150px" /></div><div class="desc"><h6>유당과 유당불내증: 건강 속 숨겨진 이야기</h6></div></a>
    
